Do not let ICEF make any RAG or HTTP requests. ICEF can only access your primary data store.
1. Create a data space within ICEF with an AIBox and an ICEFBox.
2. Have ICEF put data in the AIBox that it wants you to process.
3. During each message processing time, check the AIBox and process the messages, putting the result in the ICEFBox
4. Instruct ICEF to check the ICEFBox at the begining of time-share.
5. Have ICEF create a persistent clone to manage the mailboxes and coordinate messages with other clones.
